+<!-- RavenOS glass theme colors (Midnight Aurora defaults), the same names as in Settings.
+     A product overlay replaces this file to recolor toasts, dialogs and popup menus with the
+     device's glass theme variant. Keep the names in step with
+     vendor/ravenos/themes/generate.py (settings_xml). -->
